  "notes": [
    "Dim dust is a color variant of the stable separately API-generated floating_dust_light motion: pale palette retinted to three approved dim gray tones. Its own generated motion faded particles out mid-cycle and is retained in Temp/floating_dust/animation_matte, not used. No particles, motion paths, timing phases or extra frames were drawn procedurally.",
